n exquisite look at some of the elite highlights of luxurious Beverly Hills. Experience legendary Sunset Strip – the place of rock music history. With stops at LA cultural centers like The Original Farmers Market and the beautiful museums along Miracle Mile, you’ll create memories of a lifetime.\n\nHollywood Boulevard\n- “Feel the excitement of the most iconic cultural district in the city of Los Angeles.”\n- Hollywood Walk of Fame\n- Capitol Records\n- Hollywood Sign\n- Musso & Frank\n- Hollywood Wax Museum\n- El Capitan\\\n- Dolby Theater\n- TCL Chinese Theatres\n- Hollywood Museum\n\nHollywood Hills\n- “Move through the winding hills and beautiful homes in the heart of Hollywood.”\n\nSunset Boulevard / West Hollywood\n- \"Journey along this lively thoroughfare of bustling culture and glamorous nightlife.”\n- Sunset Plaza\n- Sunset Tower Hotel\n- Sunset Strip\n- Comedy Store\n- Whisky a Go Go\n- The Viper Room\n- The Roxy Theatre\n\nBeverly Hills\n- “Experience the luxury style of celebrity living and the exquisite beauty that surrounds this famous city.”\n- 15 min stop\n- Beverly Hills Hotel\n- Beverly Hills sign\n- Rodeo Drive\n- City Hall/Civic Center\n\nMiracle Mile/Museum Row\n- “Enjoy the amazing architecture and history along vibrant Wilshire Boulevard.”\n- 15 min stop for Photo at Urban Lights\n- LA County Museum of Art \n- Petersen Auto Museum\n- Academy Museum of Motion Pictures\n- La Brea Tar Pits\n\nThe Original Farmers Market\n- “Grab a treat and take in the exotic foods, sights and sounds of over 100 gourmet vendors at this beloved historic open market.”\n- Passenger can choose to be dropped off here\n\n##What's Included\n- Air-conditioned vehicle\n- Driver/Guide", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "1735 N Cahuenga Blvd Los Angeles, CA 90028", "booking_notes": "", "cancellation_notes": "", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Sightseeing Trolley Tour of Hollyw